[
  {
    "title": "Parallel & Distributed Computing",
    "tag": "LESSON 26",
    "code": "Chapter 5 · Computer systems and networks",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Parallel &amp;<br>Distributed</h1><p class=\"zh\">顺序 · 并行 · 分布式 · 综合调查</p><p class=\"small\">90 minutes · Compare time, resources and communication</p>",
    "note": "本课先建立计算任务的时间模型，再串联网络与数据交付。并行和分布式不是互斥标签，也不是多设备一定自动加速。",
    "kind": "dark",
    "time": "0–2 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve communication and model limits",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL",
    "code": "CSN-1.C/E",
    "html": "<p>Why can a network need an alternative path? Why can a receiver need to retry missing data?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">An alternative may preserve connectivity after failure. A retry may recover missing data needed for completion.</div></details>",
    "note": "提醒分布式程序也依赖通信，但不把本课所有任务都设为必须联网。并行可在一台多处理器设备内完成。",
    "time": "2–6 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "A comparison needs the same completed work",
    "tag": "TARGETS",
    "code": "CSN-2.A/B",
    "html": "<ul><li>Keep task sizes and dependencies fixed.</li><li>Count serial work, parallel work and overhead.</li><li>Compare completion time using a stated baseline.</li></ul><p class=\"small\">Evidence: schedules, speedup calculations and a chapter investigation report.</p>",
    "note": "比较效率必须相同任务、输入与完成条件，不能比较一方案做完另一方案只做一部分。时间单位使用抽象timeunits，不伪称真实CPU秒数。",
    "time": "6–8 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Three computing models",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "code": "CSN-2.A.1–3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Sequential describes ordered work, parallel describes overlap, and distributed describes work across devices.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sequential describes ordered work, parallel describes overlap, and distributed describes work across devices.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Sequential</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">one operation</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">at a time</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Parallel</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">some operations</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">at the same time</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Distributed</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">multiple devices</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">run a program</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">A distributed solution may also use parallel execution.</p>",
    "note": "CSN-2.A.1–3。并行描述时间重叠，分布式描述多个设备参与，不是三个互不重叠集合。设备内多核并行不必分布式；多设备有等待或依赖，未必所有操作同一时刻。",
    "time": "8–12 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Dependencies determine what may overlap",
    "tag": "MODEL CONTRACT",
    "code": "CSN-2.A/B",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"All four independent jobs wait for serial setup, then may be assigned to available processors.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"All four independent jobs wait for serial setup, then may be assigned to available processors.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Serial setup</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2 time units first</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Independent jobs</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">A=6, B=4, C=3, D=3</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Completion</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">all jobs finished</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Jobs cannot start before setup; no job is split across processors in this model.</p>",
    "note": "固定合同：setup2只做一次，之后四个独立不可分工作。不是把一项6单位任务拆六个并行份；任务间独立但都依赖setup。",
    "time": "12–16 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "One processor completes the jobs in order",
    "tag": "WORKED SCHEDULE",
    "code": "CSN-2.A.5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A processor schedule with two serial setup units followed by jobs of six, four, three and three units.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A processor schedule with two serial setup units followed by jobs of six, four, three and three units.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 135\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"30\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">Time</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">0</text><text x=\"299\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2</text><text x=\"487\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">6</text><text x=\"675\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">10</text><text x=\"863\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">14</text><text x=\"1051\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">18</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">P1</text><rect x=\"205\" y=\"50\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"252\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">setup</text><rect x=\"299\" y=\"50\" width=\"282\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"440.0\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A: 6</text><rect x=\"581\" y=\"50\" width=\"188\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"675.0\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B: 4</text><rect x=\"769\" y=\"50\" width=\"141\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"839.5\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C: 3</text><rect x=\"910\" y=\"50\" width=\"141\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"980.5\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D: 3</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Runtime = 2 + 6 + 4 + 3 + 3 = 18 time units.</p>",
    "note": "时间轴为从程序开始的绝对时间。黄色setup发生0到2，然后A2到8、B8到12、C12到15、D15到18。为后续speedup提供顺序基线。",
    "time": "16–20 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Two processors follow the assignment rule",
    "tag": "WORKED SCHEDULE",
    "code": "CSN-2.A.6",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A processor schedule with two serial setup units followed by jobs of six, four, three and three units.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A processor schedule with two serial setup units followed by jobs of six, four, three and three units.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 185\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"30\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">Time</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">0</text><text x=\"299\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2</text><text x=\"487\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">6</text><text x=\"675\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">10</text><text x=\"863\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">14</text><text x=\"1051\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">18</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">P1</text><rect x=\"205\" y=\"50\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"252\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">setup</text><rect x=\"299\" y=\"50\" width=\"282\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"440.0\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A: 6</text><rect x=\"581\" y=\"50\" width=\"141\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"651.5\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D: 3</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">P2</text><rect x=\"205\" y=\"100\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"252\" y=\"127\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">wait</text><rect x=\"299\" y=\"100\" width=\"188\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"393.0\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B: 4</text><rect x=\"487\" y=\"100\" width=\"141\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"557.5\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C: 3</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Assign jobs in list order to the earliest free processor. Ties use the lower processor number.</p><p class=\"visual-note\">P1 finishes at 11; P2 at 9. Total runtime = 11.</p>",
    "note": "A在P1从2到8，B在P2从2到6，C按顺序去先空闲P2从6到9，D去P1从8到11。不能重新排序求最优，也不能所有四任务同时开始。setup只在P1执行，P2等待。",
    "time": "20–24 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Four processors can start all four jobs",
    "tag": "WORKED SCHEDULE",
    "code": "CSN-2.A.6",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A processor schedule with two serial setup units followed by jobs of six, four, three and three units.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A processor schedule with two serial setup units followed by jobs of six, four, three and three units.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 285\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"30\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">Time</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">0</text><text x=\"299\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2</text><text x=\"487\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">6</text><text x=\"675\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">10</text><text x=\"863\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">14</text><text x=\"1051\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">18</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">P1</text><rect x=\"205\" y=\"50\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"252\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">setup</text><rect x=\"299\" y=\"50\" width=\"282\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"440.0\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A: 6</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">P2</text><rect x=\"205\" y=\"100\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"252\" y=\"127\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">wait</text><rect x=\"299\" y=\"100\" width=\"188\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"393.0\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B: 4</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"178\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">P3</text><rect x=\"205\" y=\"150\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"252\" y=\"177\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">wait</text><rect x=\"299\" y=\"150\" width=\"141\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"369.5\" y=\"178\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C: 3</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">P4</text><rect x=\"205\" y=\"200\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"252\" y=\"227\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">wait</text><rect x=\"299\" y=\"200\" width=\"141\" height=\"38\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"369.5\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D: 3</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Runtime = setup 2 + longest job 6 = 8 time units.</p>",
    "note": "共同setup完成时2，四处理器各领一项任务。最后A到8结束，其他更早但程序需等全部完成。不能把6+4+3+3除4=4而说总6，因为不可分任务长度不相同。",
    "time": "24–28 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Speedup compares baseline time with new time",
    "tag": "CALCULATE",
    "code": "CSN-2.A.7",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Speedup equals sequential runtime divided by parallel runtime for the same task.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Speedup equals sequential runtime divided by parallel runtime for the same task.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Sequential baseline</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">18 units</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Parallel time</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">8 units</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Speedup</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">18 ÷ 8 = 2.25</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Two processors: 18/11 ≈ 1.64. Four processors: 2.25.</p>",
    "note": "speedup是无量纲比值，不写2.25seconds。增加至4处理器没有4倍，因为setup与任务大小限制。保留分数18/11也完全正确，四舍五入需适当符号。",
    "time": "28–32 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Communication and coordination add overhead",
    "tag": "TRADEOFF",
    "code": "CSN-2.B · explicit model",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"In a separate small example, two one-unit jobs follow a two-unit setup and incur two extra coordination units.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"In a separate small example, two one-unit jobs follow a two-unit setup and incur two extra coordination units.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Serial setup</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2 units</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Parallel phase</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">one unit for</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">two 1-unit jobs</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Overhead</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2 units more</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">Separate example: sequential 4 units; parallel 2 + 1 + 2 = 5 units.</p>",
    "note": "此为另一个纸面小例，任务[1,1]，不是Lab固定[6,4,3,3]。小工作量被开销抵消，说明并行可能更慢。开销可以来自调度、通信、合并结果；不是每个现实程序都有同一固定值。",
    "time": "32–36 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "More processors cannot remove required serial work",
    "tag": "LIMIT",
    "code": "CSN-2.B.1/5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The fixed job model cannot finish faster than serial setup plus its longest unsplittable job.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The fixed job model cannot finish faster than serial setup plus its longest unsplittable job.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Required setup</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">2 units</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Longest indivisible job</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">6 units</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Fixed-model minimum</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">at least 8 units</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">With these four jobs, processors beyond four cannot reduce this 8-unit minimum.</p>",
    "note": "一般序列部分限制加速，本特定模型还有不可分6单位工作限制。不要从CSN公式推为任意数量processor都能让总parallelphase变0。完成8已经达到本合同下限，零开销最大speedup2.25。",
    "time": "36–40 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Chapter investigation: verify connectivity",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.A/B",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 325\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text><circle cx=\"1080\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1080\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\"><a href=\"Chapter_5_Network_Lab.html#networks\" target=\"_blank\">Networks</a>: reset links, predict and record S-to-T route and hop count.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">S–A–C–T, 3 hops. This is the model’s chosen route, not a bandwidth measurement.</div></details>",
    "note": "40–44分钟综合调查1。建立一份记录页四栏：网络、数据交付、计算时间、限制。首站需有预测/实际，不只截图。",
    "time": "40–44 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Test the communication failure boundary",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.E · CSN-2.B",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The six-node undirected classroom network.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 325\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 8\"/><path d=\"M216.0 106.0L234.0 124.0M216.0 124.0L234.0 106.0\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 8\"/><path d=\"M216.0 216.0L234.0 234.0M216.0 234.0L234.0 216.0\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"710\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"710\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#647381\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"60\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text><circle cx=\"710\" cy=\"280\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text><circle cx=\"1080\" cy=\"170\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1080\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\"><a href=\"Chapter_5_Network_Lab.html#resilience\" target=\"_blank\">Resilience</a>: compare only A–C failed with both S–A and S–B failed.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">A–C alone: an alternative remains. Both S links: S is isolated. Extra processors do not restore a missing communication path.</div></details>",
    "note": "44–48分钟综合调查2。跨概念连接：计算资源不能替代通信可达性。每次reset避免保留上次关闭边，比较单边与二边集合。",
    "time": "44–48 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Verify complete data before processing",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1.C",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Packet IDs and three-character chunks. The visible symbol denotes a space.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Packet IDs and three-character chunks. The visible symbol denotes a space.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 225\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"35\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"165\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 1</text><text x=\"165\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">HEL</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"455\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 2</text><text x=\"455\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">LO␠</text><rect x=\"615\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"745\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 3</text><text x=\"745\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">missing</text><rect x=\"905\" y=\"30\" width=\"260\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1035\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ID 4</text><text x=\"1035\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">CSP</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#647381\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">␠ represents one space</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\"><a href=\"Chapter_5_Network_Lab.html#packets\" target=\"_blank\">Packets</a>: lose ID 3, inspect the buffer, then retry it.</p><p class=\"small\">Record when complete reconstruction becomes justified.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Only after all four required chunks have arrived, including ID 3. More processors cannot invent an unreceived chunk.</div></details>",
    "note": "48–52分钟综合调查3。这是“需要完整输入再计算”情境，不能声称所有应用任何时候都不能流式处理。课堂固定目标是完整重组消息，数据完整是该任务条件。",
    "time": "48–52 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Predict and run processor schedules",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 6 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-2.A",
    "html": "<p class=\"small\"><a href=\"Chapter_5_Network_Lab.html#parallel\" target=\"_blank\">Parallel</a>: setup 2; jobs A=6, B=4, C=3, D=3; overhead 0.</p><p>Predict total runtime for 1, 2 and 4 processors. Run each and compare your schedule.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">1 processor: 18. 2: 11. 4: 8. All times include the serial setup.</div></details>",
    "note": "52–58分钟综合调查4。6分钟分组手排再看Lab，错2处理器常是18/2=9或2+6=8，分别忽略依赖/工作排队。要求写P1/P2任务分配而不只猜数字。",
    "time": "52–58 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Measure the effect of the stated overhead",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 6 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-2.A.7/B",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Six units of overhead are added after the two-processor schedule finishes.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Six units of overhead are added after the two-processor schedule finishes.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">2 processors</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">base runtime 11</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Extra overhead</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">6 units after jobs</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">New runtime</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">predict before Run</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Keep the no-overhead sequential baseline 18. Calculate runtime and speedup.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Runtime = 17. Speedup = 18/17 ≈ 1.06. The advantage is much smaller than 18/11.</div></details>",
    "note": "58–64分钟综合调查5。合同overhead只在parallelphase后加一次，不把6加给每项工作。此0到6范围不会让固定2/4处理器慢于18，别虚构交叉点；第10页另一个小例才展示可能更慢。",
    "time": "58–64 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Connect the four observations",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1 · CSN-2",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"A distributed-task explanation connects communication, available data and computation time.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A distributed-task explanation connects communication, available data and computation time.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Reachability</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">a usable route</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Complete input</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">required chunks received</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Execution</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">schedule + overhead</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Explain why fixing only one stage may leave another bottleneck.</p>",
    "note": "64–68分钟综合调查6。结论不是把三个独立Lab实测时间相加，因为网图和包模型没有真实时间单位。可解释逻辑依赖，但不能宣称已测真实分布式程序整体性能。",
    "time": "64–68 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Submit a chapter investigation report",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE · 4 MIN",
    "code": "CSN-1 · CSN-2",
    "html": "<ul><li>One successful route and one disconnecting failure set</li><li>A missing-packet and retry observation</li><li>Three processor runtimes and one overhead comparison</li><li>A limitation and a justified improvement</li></ul><p class=\"small\"><a href=\"output/pdf/AP_CSP_Chapter_5_Investigation_Sheet.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Investigation record PDF</a> · Separate observed model results from real-system predictions.</p>",
    "note": "68–72分钟综合调查7。至少30分钟要求由40–72完整32分钟实现。四项成形可短但需数字、路径和具体限制；不要求额外正式Create程序。",
    "time": "68–72 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Distributed computing expands available resources",
    "tag": "TRANSFER",
    "code": "CSN-2.B.3/4",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Multiple devices can contribute processing or storage, while coordination remains necessary.\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Multiple devices can contribute processing or storage, while coordination remains necessary.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Device 1</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">part of a large job</text><path d=\"M383.0 103L411.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"411.0,103 399.0,97.0 399.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"416.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Device 2</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">another part</text><path d=\"M789.0 103L817.0 103\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"817.0,103 805.0,97.0 805.0,109.0\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"822.0\" y=\"28\" width=\"368.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#eef3f6\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Coordination</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">exchange data</text><text x=\"1006.0\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">combine results</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">It can enable problems too large for one device, but data exchange has costs.</p>",
    "note": "CSN-2.B.3–4，处理时间和存储需求均可促成分布式。不是仅速度，资源规模也重要。分布式可有并行，也可含大量顺序等待，不能保证每个问题总更快。",
    "time": "72–76 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "A serial lower bound is a bound, not a promise",
    "tag": "REASON ABOUT LIMITS",
    "code": "CSN-2.B.5",
    "html": "<p>Suppose a task takes 18 units sequentially and has 2 unavoidable serial units.</p><p class=\"small\">Even if the remaining work could be divided without limit, runtime cannot be below 2. Speedup cannot exceed 18/2 = 9.</p><p class=\"small\">Our fixed indivisible jobs impose the stronger 8-unit minimum and 2.25 speedup.</p>",
    "note": "这是理想上界推理，不宣称可达到9；有serial2且非零其他工作时通常只能逼近更宽界。固定四项工作则6不可分让最小8，不能用9取代本Lab正确最大2.25。不要求Amdahl公式。",
    "time": "76–80 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Original chapter check: select TWO",
    "tag": "CHECK",
    "code": "CSN-1.C/E · CSN-2",
    "html": "<ul><li>A. Four processors always make a program four times faster.</li><li>B. A distributed solution may also execute work in parallel.</li><li>C. Two routes guarantee every packet arrives.</li><li>D. Required serial work limits possible speedup.</li></ul><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">B and D. A ignores dependencies and overhead; C confuses route alternatives with delivery guarantees.</div></details>",
    "note": "整章选两项从计算与网络交叉错因检查。若学生选A，要求引用18/8而非凭设备数量。",
    "time": "80–84 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Homework and chapter evidence",
    "tag": "HOMEWORK",
    "code": "Chapter 5",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">12 original questions · 30 teacher marks</p><p class=\"small\">Keep your schedules, failure table and packet record. Explain every ratio and model assumption.</p><p class=\"small\">Next chapter examines responsible and secure use of connected systems.</p>",
    "note": "作业综合第五章，但不把后章安全知识提前纳入评分。资料中的timeunits不是实际CPU测量；语义与模型范围需一并保留。",
    "time": "84–87 min"
  },
  {
    "title": "Exit ticket",
    "tag": "EXIT",
    "code": "CSN-2.A/B",
    "html": "<p>1. What makes computing distributed?<br>2. Why does the two-processor model take 11, not 9?<br>3. What is the four-processor speedup at zero overhead?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. Multiple devices run the program.<br>2. Serial setup and the specified assignment create unequal processor workloads.<br>3. 18/8 = 2.25.</div></details>",
    "note": "各1分。第2题需要说调度/最长负载而不只是“公式如此”。不能以总工作16/2再加setup2=10代替实际固定顺序调度11。",
    "time": "87–90 min"
  }
]
